		{"id":"f266915c9f59140d","type":"text","text":"|                 |                |                                                                                                                |                                                                |     |       |\n| --------------- | -------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- | --- | ----- |\n| Name            | Type           | Effect                                                                                                         | Visuals                                                        |     | Done? |\n| Kalasirios      | Creature       |                                                                                                                | a spearman with a large wicker shield, wearing a bright tunic. |     | Yes   |\n| Spear-Prince    | Creature       | On turn: Bolster all Throne cards +1/+1. On turn: Gain either 1 stack of Command or 1 stack of Logistics.      |                                                                |     | No    |\n| Command         | Effect Counter | When this creature Bolsters an ally’s Attack, increase the effect by the number of stacks                      |                                                                |     | No    |\n| Logistics       | Effect Counter | When this creature Bolsters an ally’s Health, increase the effect by the number of stacks.                     |                                                                |     | No    |\n| Guardmaster     | Upgrade        | On turn: gain 1 Armor.                                                                                         |                                                                |     | Yes   |\n| Armor           | Effect Counter | for each stack, increase effective health when defending.                 